# Encrypts each artist's own secrets at rest: SMTP password (Settings > Email)
# and Razorpay key secret / webhook secret (Settings > Razorpay).
# Generate with: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# Must be exactly 64 hex characters (32 bytes). Losing/rotating this key
# invalidates every artist's already-saved secrets.
EMAIL_ENCRYPTION_KEY=""
